BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ev_plantmania_expo_daphne_1023-2026-10-24@coastaleventures.com
DTSTAMP:20261024T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261024
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261025
SUMMARY:Plantmania Expo 2026
LOCATION:Daphne Civic Center\, 2603 US Highway 98\, Daphne\, AL 36526
DESCRIPTION:Friday 10/23 · 10:00 AM to 5:00 PM · Saturday 10/24 · 10:00 
 AM to 4:00 PM\n\nPlantmania brings a two-day tropical plant expo to the Da
 phne Civic Center\, with live workshops\, free classes\, plant care and pr
 opagation demonstrations and a marketplace of plant vendors and makers. Ge
 neral entry is $15 and children 12 and under get in free. Classes come wit
 h entry\, while the Kokedama\, Terrarium and Staghorn Fern workshops cost 
 extra.\n\nPrice: from $15\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/
 ev-plantmania-expo-daphne-1023.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-plantmania-expo-daphne-1023.html
CATEGORIES:Nature and outdoors
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
