 om
DTSTAMP:20261024T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261024T070000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261024T130000
SUMMARY:Heroes on the Water kayak fishing day
LOCATION:Archie Glover Boat Ramp\, 2306 N 14th Ave\, Milton\, FL 32583
DESCRIPTION:Saturday 10/24 · 7:00 AM to 1:00 PM\n\nThe Emerald Coast chapt
 er of Heroes on the Water runs a morning of kayaking and kayak fishing at 
 no cost for veterans\, active duty\, first responders and their families. 
 The chapter brings the kayaks\, fishing gear and safety equipment\, and lu
 nch is provided. Chapter events are open only to veterans\, first responde
 rs and their family members.\n\nPrice: Free\n\nDetails: https://coastaleve
 ntures.com/events/ev-heroes-on-the-water-archie-glover-1024.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-heroes-on-the-water-archie-glove
 r-1024.html
CATEGORIES:Nature and outdoors
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ev_navarre_beach_bird_walk_1024-2026-10-24@coastaleventures.com
DTSTAMP:20261024T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261024T073000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261024T083000
SUMMARY:Navarre Beach Park and Big Sabine Point bird walk
LOCATION:Sandpiper Pavilion\, Navarre Beach Park\, Sandpiper Pavilion\, Nav
 arre Beach Park\, Navarre Beach\, FL 32566
DESCRIPTION:Saturday 10/24 · meet at 7:30 AM\n\nChoctawhatchee Audubon Soc
 iety's Jim Anderton leads a Saturday morning walk looking for shorebirds\,
  rails and migrating species. The group birds Navarre Beach Park for about
  an hour\, then drives together to the east lot of Pensacola Beach Park to
  search Big Sabine Point. The second part is optional and includes a dune 
 hike and maybe wet ground.\n\nPrice: Free\n\nDetails: https://coastalevent
 ures.com/events/ev-navarre-beach-bird-walk-1024.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-navarre-beach-bird-walk-1024.htm
 l
CATEGORIES:Nature and outdoors
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
