SUMMARY:Ocean Hour Saturday Cleanups: Fall Schedule
LOCATION:Ocean Hour cleanup sites around Pensacola\, Rotating sites around 
 Pensacola and Pensacola Beach\; see the schedule on oceanhourfl.com
DESCRIPTION:Saturdays 10/24 to 11/28 · 8:45 AM\n\nOcean Hour holds one hou
 r volunteer cleanups on Saturday mornings at 8:45 AM at parks\, trailheads
  and beaches around Pensacola and Pensacola Beach. The fall schedule runs 
 from October 24 through November 28\, with two or three sites each week. V
 olunteers only need closed toe shoes\, water and sunscreen\, and Ocean Hou
 r supplies all equipment.\n\nPrice: Free\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventu
 res.com/events/ev-oceanhour-saturday-cleanups-fall-1017.html
