SUMMARY:Boo at the Zoo 2026
LOCATION:Gulf Breeze Zoo\, 5701 Gulf Breeze Parkway\, Gulf Breeze\, FL 3256
 3
DESCRIPTION:Sat 10/24\, Sun 10/25\, Sat 10/31 and Sun 11/1 · zoo opens 10 
 AM (the 10/17-10/18 weekend is cancelled after Isaias)\n\nGulf Breeze Zoo 
 turns its grounds into a Halloween trick-or-treat trail for the day\, with
  candy\, toys\, bounce houses\, face painting and the zoo's animal ambassa
 dors out to meet visitors. The zoo opens at 10 AM for the event and does n
 ot admit guests earlier\, and a Boo at the Zoo ticket includes regular zoo
  admission.\n\nPrice: No published price\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventu
 res.com/events/ev-boo-at-the-zoo-2026-1010.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-boo-at-the-zoo-2026-1010.html
CATEGORIES:Nature and outdoors
