DTSTAMP:20261024T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261031
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261101
SUMMARY:Trash Bash Beach Clean-Up
LOCATION:Navarre Beach Sea Turtle Conservation Center\, 8740 Gulf Blvd\, Na
 varre\, FL 32566
DESCRIPTION:Saturday 10/31 · Time not published\n\nThe Sea Turtle Conserva
 tion Center runs Trash Bash\, a volunteer beach clean-up along Navarre Bea
 ch\, on the last Saturday of every month. Volunteers collect trash and log
  what they find for state and federal marine debris tracking. The center's
  own page names the day but does not publish a meeting time\, so call ahea
 d to confirm.\n\nPrice: No published price\n\nDetails: https://coastaleven
 tures.com/events/ev-trashbash-navarre-1031.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-trashbash-navarre-1031.html
CATEGORIES:Nature and outdoors
