SUMMARY:88th Annual Camellia Flower Show
LOCATION:Jean and Paul Amos Performance Studio\, Pensacola State College\, 
 1000 College Blvd\, Bldg 23\, Pensacola\, FL 32504
DESCRIPTION:Saturday 12/12 · 1:00 PM to 4:00 PM\n\nCamellia growers from f
 ive Gulf States enter more than 1\,000 blooms in the Pensacola Camellia Cl
 ub's 88th show\, judged as greenhouse-grown and outdoor-grown. The show is
  in the Amos studio at Pensacola State College\, with free parking in the 
 Amos lot. The club's page gives the date\, and the 1 to 4 PM hours come fr
 om Visit Pensacola.\n\nPrice: No published price\n\nDetails: https://coast
 aleventures.com/events/ev-camellia-flower-show-1212.html
